{
  "id": "ch01_s08_shuge",
  "chapter": 1,
  "act": 1,
  "scene": "shuge",
  "palette": "gold",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "liqinghe",
    "tangjian"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "宫内策问试收无荐卷，以明确限额或时限分担经办成本",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "离开园门，你带着自己的卷进了书阁。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l2",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "替谁送卷？送卷的簿上没记你的名字。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l3",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "公主。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l4",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l5",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我呈自己的卷。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l6",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "自己的卷，便由你答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l7",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l8",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "唐典记，给她记上一行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_recopy": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "晨光落在你的指腹上，补抄的墨还没洗净。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_recopy": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你忙着补抄，提前看题的时辰已经过了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_recopy": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那就现在给我题吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_recopy": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今日得当场读。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_recopy": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "请给我半刻。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_recopy": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "半刻？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_recopy": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没看过就没看过，漏答的也记我名下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_recopy": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "读，我只等半刻。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_append": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "晨光照着附改处，新旧两道墨迹一同留在案上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l18",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_append": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "考试接着办了，你还得解释纸上为何有两种写法。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_append": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这两道？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l20",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_append": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "纸上写要骑，裴将军教的却是牵着走。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l21",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_append": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "更正处有我的署名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l22",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_append": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我看见了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l23",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_append": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "改前改后的都留着，日后才查得清。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l24",
      "when": {
        "flag.trial_append": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "听明白了，这段问答也留着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l25",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "李令仪扶住高冠，拢起大袖礼衣的袖子，再将册子压平。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l26",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "风从书阁门缝钻进来；公主翻到末尾，荐名栏尽了，纸还剩半页。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l27",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没人举荐，自己送来的卷放哪里？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l28",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "公主。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l29",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你问的是自己报名的人？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l30",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这一批原先没收这种卷。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l31",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可没人举荐，也未必答不好这道题。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l32",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "半页纸写得下十个名字，也不会凭空多出十个人手。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l33",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那就——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l34",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "谁看完十份卷？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l35",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l36",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我还得查病舍领了多少东西，不能再熬一夜。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l37",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那些颂辞，能不能少抄几本？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l38",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "说下去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l39",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "省下的钱，付给抄这些新卷的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l40",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "誊本可以省，原文留一份；能省多少？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l41",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我算算。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l42",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "温荞那里接得下几份，价钱得先定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l43",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先把工价定了，再问谁肯接。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l44",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "抄多少，领多少。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l45",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不能卷没入选，抄工就白做。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l46",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可以。抄卷的钱照付，卷好不好另评。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l47",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l48",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "公主抽走两份重复的颂辞誊本，空出一处实实在在的位置。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l49",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "自己报名的卷，可以另收。先定下什么时候不再收。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l50",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是收满便停，还是等到定下的时辰？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l51",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l52",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "定份数，先满先止；定时辰，到时收齐。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l53",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "份数一满，晚知道的人便吃亏。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l54",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "定时辰，来的多就得延后评完，荐名卷也一样得等。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l55",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "有举荐的人，也不能先评。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l56",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你看她拢住紫色大袖，手掌压着册子，抬眼等你。",
      "image": "liqinghe_1_boyi"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l57",
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（她真等我选。别只顾着看她。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l58",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这两笔代价，你选哪笔？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l59",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "唐简拿起木夹，把“自呈”两字夹在空出的案边。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l60",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "自己送来的卷，不能总排在有举荐的后面。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.l61",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一同评。我看答得有没有用，不看是谁荐来的。"
    }
  ],
  "dressing": "gongyi",
  "choices": [
    {
      "id": "ch01_s08_shuge.cA",
      "text": "先收六份，满额便明示",
      "effects": {
        "shi": 1,
        "ming": -1,
